                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "2 · Same engine, prior-art chevron styling. In Source mode, type a type name (e.g. \"Po\") — the autocomplete popup now paints ON TOP of everything on the canvas: drag an arrow straight through it and the list stays fully readable."
