                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "4 · Four Code blocks, four different settings. Select any one — ONE shared pill controls language, text size, line numbers, and character width. NEW: the Font size menu has a Custom row under the presets — type any px (say 29) and the text renders at exactly that size; it works the same on a plain Text shape or a sticky note. Clicking a preset snaps cleanly back."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
